    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.RestartRequired">After changing settings here, you need to restart the lobby for them to take effect.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.Username">Username</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.Username.ToolTip">PCL CE will try to use the username here for lobby display.&#x0a;If left blank, the Natayark ID username will be used.&#x0a;&#x0a;In some cases, the Natayark ID username may always be displayed instead of the name set here.</sys:String>
