    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.LatencyFirstMode">Select lowest latency path instead of shortest path</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.LatencyFirstMode.ToolTip">When enabled, EasyTier will choose the path with the lowest latency, rather than the path with the fewest routing hops.&#x0a;Enabling this may reduce latency in some cases, but may increase packet loss.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.PortGuessNat">Perform port guessing for symmetric NAT</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.PortGuessNat.ToolTip">Let EasyTier attempt port guessing for symmetric NAT (birthday paradox).&#x0a;This may improve the online experience, but in some cases may also cause issues.&#x0a;Generally, keep it on.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.EnableIPv6">Allow IPv6 communication</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.EnableIPv6.ToolTip">IPv6 makes P2P communication easier compared to IPv4, greatly improving the online experience. Do not disable unless you have a specific reason.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.CliDebugOutput">Output CLI info in logs for debugging</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameLink.CliDebugOutput.ToolTip">Output EasyTier CLI info every 30s in the launcher log for developer and community support investigation.&#x0a;This option is for debugging purposes only. It is not recommended to keep it always on.</sys:String>
