    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Update.OtherOptions.Placeholder">AquaCL 3 is the first major update of PCL CE, bringing a refreshing new design, using the latest development technologies, completely rebuilding the core experience, and adding support for macOS, Linux, and other platforms.</sys:String>
