    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.AdvancedMaterial.ToolTip">When enabled, a blur effect will be applied to some transparent areas (e.g. cards).&#x0a;Note that this feature consumes significant GPU resources and may cause lag!</sys:String>
