    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.Gaussian.ToolTip">Uses weighted average sampling with a Gaussian convolution algorithm over a large area around each pixel, which is slower.&#x0a;This blur has higher quality and handles details more finely. Recommended for devices with better performance.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.Box">Box Blur</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.Box.ToolTip">Uses linear average sampling over a small area around each pixel, which is faster but may produce color blocks.&#x0a;This blur may lose detail information but has better performance. Can be used if device performance is poor.</sys:String>
